        "Entities are named as the interface names them: a feature by its tree name (Boss-Extrude1), a face or edge \
         as `<feature> · <label>` (Boss-Extrude1 · End cap, Boss-Extrude1 · Edge 3), a vertex as `<feature> · \
         Vertex <n>`."
